MigrateIntegrationConcreteTest
├── When the new pool launcher is not set
│   └── It should revert with {NewPoolLauncherNotSet}
└── When the new pool launcher is set
    ├── When the caller is not the locker owner
    │   └── It should revert with {NotLockerOwner}
    └── When the caller is the locker owner
        ├── When the locker has expired
        │   └── It should revert with {NotLocked}
        └── When the locker has not expired
            ├── When the underlying pool is not registered in pool launcher
            │   └── It should revert with {PoolNotInPoolLauncher}
            └── When the underlying pool is registered in pool launcher
                ├── When the amounts to unlock are smaller than the amounts to migrate
                │   └── It should revert with {InsufficientPoolLauncherUnlockMin}
                └── When the amounts to unlock are greater than or equal to the amounts to migrate
                    ├── When the amounts unlocked are smaller than the min amounts to unlock
                    │   └── It should revert with {PS}
                    └── When the amounts unlocked are greater than or equal to the min amounts to unlock
                        ├── When the amounts migrated are smaller than the min amounts
                        │   └── It should revert with {PSC}
                        └── When the amounts migrated are greater than or equal to the min amounts
                            ├── When the pool launcher token is token0
                            │   ├── It should migrate the pool launcher pool to the new pool launcher
                            │   ├── It should migrate the locker to the new locker factory
                            │   ├── It should refund leftover to new locker
                            │   └── It should emit a {Migrate} event
                            └── When the pool launcher token is token1
                                ├── It should sort the tokens
                                ├── It should migrate the pool launcher pool to the new pool launcher
                                ├── It should migrate the locker to the new locker factory
                                ├── It should refund leftover to new locker
                                └── It should emit a {Migrate} event
